{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_123_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_123","textTraditional":"一、九年，春王正月，公如齊。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_123_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_123","textTraditional":"二、公至自齊。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_123_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_123","textTraditional":"三、夏，仲孫蔑如京師。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_123_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_123","textTraditional":"四、齊侯伐萊。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_123_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_123","textTraditional":"五、秋，取根牟。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_123_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_123","textTraditional":"根牟者何？邾婁之邑也。曷為不繫乎邾婁？諱亟也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_123_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_123","textTraditional":"六、八月，滕子卒。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_123_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_123","textTraditional":"七、九月，晉侯、宋公、衞侯、鄭伯、曹伯會于扈。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_123_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_123","textTraditional":"八、晉荀林父帥師伐陳。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_123_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_123","textTraditional":"九、辛酉，晉侯黑臀卒于扈。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_123_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_123","textTraditional":"扈者何？晉之邑也。諸侯卒其封內不地，此何以地？卒于會，故地也。未出其地，故不言會也。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_123_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_123","textTraditional":"十、冬十月癸酉，衞侯鄭卒。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_cdt_123_13","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_123","textTraditional":"十一、宋人圍滕。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_cdt_123_14","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_123","textTraditional":"十二、楚子伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_cdt_123_15","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_123","textTraditional":"十三、晉郤缺帥師救鄭。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_cdt_123_16","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_123","textTraditional":"十四、陳殺其大夫泄冶。","sentenceOrder":16}],"overrides":{}}